[[31,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Raise the head restraint (1a) until it is in the end of travel position, press the buttons (1b) and remove it from the seat.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194001484.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the head restraint (1a) and push it until it locks, then adjust the height using the button (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194001485.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]